Ricoh GreenLine remanufactured multi-function printers undergo meticulous disassembly, component replacement of worn elements, firmware updates, performance testing to meet or exceed OEM specs. Devices cost 20-40% less than new equivalents while achieving identical reliability, security, and consistency. First remanufactured MFPs to earn ENERGY STAR certification; all service handled by Ricoh-authorized dealers with identical warranty support as new. ISO 9001 and 14001 certification with annual British Standards Institution audits ensures quality.